="MainD">07:35:00</in-capmkt:EndTimeOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported contextRef="MainI" unitRef="pure" decimals="0">2</in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported><in-capmkt:DateOfReport contextRef="MainI">2026-09-16</in-capmkt:DateOfReport><in-capmkt:TypeOfChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Appointment</in-capmkt:TypeOfChange><in-capmkt:CategoryForChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Senior Management Personnel</in-capmkt:CategoryForChange><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Chief Human Resource Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Ms.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">Chinmayi Trivedi</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-09-15</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:TermOfAppointmentInMonths contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1" unitRef="pure" decimals="INF">0</in-capmkt:TermOfAppointmentInMonths><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Ms. Chinmayi Trivedi is a seasoned Human Resources leader with over 20 years of experience across banking, housing finance, asset management, and financial services organizations. In her recent role, she served as Executive Vice President - Human Resources at Truhome Finance Ltd., where she was responsible for building and scaling the people function, driving talent acquisition, performance management, employee engagement, diversity &amp; inclusion, digital HR transformation, and organizational effectiveness.

Prior to joining Truhome Finance, she served as Head HR - Wholesale Finance Group at Piramal Capital &amp; Housing Finance Ltd., where she led HR strategy, talent management, compensation &amp; benefits, employee experience, digital transformation, and governance initiatives. Earlier, she held leadership roles at IDFC Ltd. and HDFC Bank Ltd., partnering closely with business leaders on organization design, performance management, employee engagement, culture transformation, and leadership development.

Throughout her career, Ms. Trivedi has successfully led several large-scale HR transformation and digitalization initiatives, developed high-performance cultures, and implemented award-winning diversity, talent, and employee engagement programs. Under her leadership, organizations have received multiple recognitions, including Great Place to Work and HR excellence awards.

Ms. Trivedi holds a Post Graduate Diploma in Business Management (HR) from N. L. Dalmia Institute of Management Studies &amp; Research and a Bachelor of Commerce degree from Mithibai College of Commerce &amp; Arts.</in-capmkt:BriefProfile><in-capmkt:TypeOfChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Cessation</in-capmkt:TypeOfChange><in-capmkt:CategoryOfCessation contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Resignation</in-capmkt:CategoryOfCessation><in-capmkt:CategoryForChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Senior Management Personnel</in-capmkt:CategoryForChange><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Chief Human Resource Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Ms.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement2">Pooja Mehta</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement2">2026-09-15</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:WhetherTheFurtherDisclosureForResignationOfStatutoryAuditorOrDirectorOrKMPsOrSMPOrComplianceOfficerIsToBeFiledAlongWithThisDisclosure contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">true</in-capmkt:WhetherTheFurtherDisclosureForResignationOfStatutoryAuditorOrDirectorOrKMPsOrSMPOrComplianceOfficerIsToBeFiledAlongWithThisDisclosure><in-capmkt:Salutation contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">Ms.</in-capmkt:Salutation><in-capmkt:NameOfTheDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">Pooja Mehta</in-capmkt:NameOfTheDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">Chief Human Resource Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceO